def maximum_energy(energy, k):
    n = len(energy)
    # dp[i] will store the maximum energy we can gain starting from position i
    dp = [0] * n

    # Process positions from right to left
    for i in range(n - 1, -1, -1):
        # If we start at position i, we get energy[i] plus the energy from the next position (i + k)
        if i + k < n:
            dp[i] = energy[i] + dp[i + k]
        else:
            dp[i] = energy[i]

    # Return the maximum energy across all possible starting positions
    return max(dp)
```

